---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Featured Builds" description="Community LS swapped Genesis Coupes — submit your build.">
  <h1>Featured Builds</h1>
  <p>
    This is the place for completed (or well-documented in-progress) LS Gen Coupe builds.
    The goal is to show real cars, real parts lists, and real lessons learned — not just glossy photos.
  </p>

  <h2>Submit Your Build — $10</h2>
  <p>
    For a one-time $10 contribution you can have your own dedicated build page that includes:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Photos of the car (engine bay, exterior, interior, etc.)</li>
    <li>Engine + transmission combo and power goals</li>
    <li>Key parts list (mounts, harness, ECU, exhaust, etc.)</li>
    <li>What went right and what you’d do differently</li>
    <li>A permanent link you can share</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The money simply helps cover domain and any small running costs so the free guides stay free.
    No ads, no subscription pressure.
  </p>

  <!-- 
    STRIPE SETUP:
    1. Create a free Stripe account at https://stripe.com
    2. Go to Products → Add product → name it "Featured Build" → price $10 one-time
    3. Create a Payment Link for that product
    4. Replace the href below with your real Payment Link URL
       (looks like: https://buy.stripe.com/xxxx)
  -->
  <a
    href="https://buy.stripe.com/test_REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_FEATURED_BUILD_LINK"
    class="stripe-btn"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener"
  >
    Pay $10 — Feature My Build
  </a>
  <p class="stripe-note">
    After payment, email your photos + write-up and we’ll get the page live.
    (Replace the button link with your real Stripe Payment Link when ready.)
  </p>

  <h2>Current Featured Builds</h2>
  <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">None yet — be the first.</p>
</BaseLayout>
